    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This report analyzes two aspects of industrial facilities: their quality; and integration in the process of developing them from inception trough the first six or more months of operations. The goals of the research are to determine what constitutes a high quality facility, and how the facility development process can be better managed to achieve this result. This report was recently published as a doctoral dissertation.",
